Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.39,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.30,0:00:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.85,0:00:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.47,0:00:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on a move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.17,0:01:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,To the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.45,0:01:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Who dares trespass?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.35,0:01:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt in the name of the pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.07,0:01:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.67,0:01:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Step aside if you value your souls!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.07,0:01:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand tall, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.09,0:01:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Sound the alarm!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.15,0:01:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahan, is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.85,0:01:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The Millennium Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.17,0:01:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We are in the presence\Nof pure evil. Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.81,0:01:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Who goes there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.05,0:02:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon the interruption, but apparently\Nsomeone left me off the guest list. Bakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.85,0:02:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.27,0:02:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, is that any way to speak\Nto an old friend, your highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.23,0:02:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe you know what\NI came here to acquire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.15,0:02:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The Millennium Items.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.85,0:02:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So you have been paying attention\Nto me all these years, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.27,0:02:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let me see if I've\Ngot this straight, shoddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.19,0:02:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way to get to the Pharaoh is to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.15,0:02:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,find a doorway inside\Nthe Millennium Puzzle?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.03,0:02:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but the puzzle\Ncontains many doorways,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.81,0:02:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,some of which lead to\Ndark and dangerous realms.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.51,0:02:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, I will guide\Nyou through this journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.95,0:02:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But when you wish to return,\NI'm afraid you're on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.89,0:02:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We got no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.47,0:02:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's do this, Yug!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.77,0:02:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,All for one and one for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.91,0:02:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.17,0:02:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, but I'm doing this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.01,0:02:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.55,0:03:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, guys, I've put all your lives\Nin danger enough times already.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.09,0:03:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This is something that I\Nneed to do for the Pharaoh,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.51,0:03:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm going to do it on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.37,0:03:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You should realize by now that\Nit can't ditch us that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.83,0:03:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We've stuck with you on every\Nadventure for the last four years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.69,0:03:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You think we're gonna\Nstop now? Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.69,0:03:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, hold hands and concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.93,0:03:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We must pool our energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.95,0:03:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, wherever you are, I will find you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.13,0:03:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.07,0:03:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,in the name of the great pharaoh,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.49,0:03:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall invoke the sacred\Nenergies of the Millennium Key
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.07,0:03:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Please guide us through the mystic\Nlabyrinth of the Millennium Puzzle
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.33,0:03:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope I didn't ruin your\Nlittle celebration, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.65,0:03:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mockery is a disgrace to the pharaoh,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.71,0:04:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and for that you shall be punished, rogue.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.85,0:04:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.19,0:04:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I reside in the outskirts of your little\Nkingdom, so your rules don't apply to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.25,0:04:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if you wouldn't mind, hand\Nover your millennium items. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.77,0:04:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.33,0:04:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I come bearing gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.49,0:04:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You stole those!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.49,0:04:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.49,0:04:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I assumed these trinkets\Nwouldn't be enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.65,0:04:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,so I brought another token of my esteem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.31,0:04:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.45,0:04:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Say hello to your previous king!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.47,0:04:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You dare disrespect the\Ntomb of a former pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.39,0:04:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you've taken this too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.81,0:04:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Korra, your soul must be\Njudged by the Millennium Items!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.35,0:04:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.53,0:04:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Guards, bring us a sealing tablet at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.19,0:04:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the Millennium Trial begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.81,0:04:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Your weak magic will never contain me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.07,0:05:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No mortal can resist the\Npower of the sacred items!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.93,0:05:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.09,0:05:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The Millennium Scale is\Nunable to find balance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.29,0:05:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That means the evil in\Nhis heart is immeasurable!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.69,0:05:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I see a darkness\Nthat knows no bounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.53,0:05:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,His soul is a bottomless pit in\Nwhich thrives a terrifying creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.89,0:05:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Millennium Key, reveal\Nthe beast that lurks within.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.09,0:05:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's no ordinary beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.99,0:05:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you see, Shaddaa?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.65,0:05:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The most powerful being\NI've ever witnessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.61,0:05:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That ceiling tablet is\Nfar too small! Ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.91,0:05:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.01,0:05:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We've never had any difficulty before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.51,0:06:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.87,0:06:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How can such a creature live\Nin the heart of a petty thief?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.51,0:06:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me introduce my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.47,0:06:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Diabound, meet the pharaoh, and pharaoh,\Nmeet the instrument of your demise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.23,0:06:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I am afraid you are mistaken, thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.27,0:06:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Your monster's fate is sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.65,0:06:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Millennium Rod, activate!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.73,0:06:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I suspected, his\Nsoul has been cleansed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.41,0:06:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Master Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.91,0:06:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.67,0:06:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That horrible creature\Nwas controlling my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.47,0:06:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'm finally free.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.91,0:06:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Free to annihilate you, that\Nis. Impossible. It didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.39,0:06:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.73,0:07:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks as if I've already won\Nthis game before it's even begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.51,0:07:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, come on. Wake up, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.87,0:07:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.13,0:07:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.15,0:07:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Rise and shine, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.95,0:07:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.27,0:07:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We're inside the Millennium\NPuzzle, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.29,0:07:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This place seems bigger than last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.01,0:07:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you do some remodeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.11,0:07:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The puzzle is a reflection of the\NPharaoh's mind and is ever-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.45,0:07:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.61,0:07:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess that explains why\Nthis place is so complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.51,0:07:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.35,0:07:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get up and find the Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.95,0:07:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, shoddy old pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.73,0:07:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Use that Millennium thingy of yours\Nand point us in the right direction!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.33,0:07:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a Millennium King!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.99,0:07:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me Yugi\Nleft the country? Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.57,0:07:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Our flight logs indicate\Nthat he boarded a jet
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.71,0:08:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,bound for Cairo with three\Ncompanions just yesterday!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.25,0:08:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would the Geek Squad fly to Egypt?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.67,0:08:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And why now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.79,0:08:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you hold on to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.11,0:08:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.09,0:08:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't this belong to Pegasus? Why, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.21,0:08:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And it holds many answers about your past.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.11,0:08:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it to Egypt, and\NI'll tell you the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.51,0:08:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But Korra must have gotten to Yugi also.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.83,0:08:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you you'd be powerless against\Nthe dark energy of my dear Bound!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.27,0:08:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sacred Guardians of the Pharaoh, we must\Nunite to conquer this adversary. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.07,0:08:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean to tell me you have dual discs?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.59,0:08:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What is a dual disc?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.91,0:08:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.82,0:08:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,that's a device used\Nfor calling forth shadow
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.53,0:08:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,creatures that have been\Nsealed away in stone tablets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.69,0:08:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Once these monsters have\Nbeen trapped in stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.87,0:08:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,they're stored in tablet\Nsanctuaries until someone
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.71,0:09:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,summons them using a\Nmechanism called a dia-dianc.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.95,0:09:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Like ancient dual discs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.87,0:09:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, can the Guardians\Ncome out and play? Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.05,0:09:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a strong one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.49,0:09:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We must combine our powers. Fear not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.39,0:09:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I can defeat this thief on my own. Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.57,0:09:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, creature of darkness,\NI call upon thee.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.53,0:09:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Awaken from thy slumber\Nand join me in this battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.73,0:09:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is how it all began.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.13,0:09:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I summon Goreskoloth!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.35,0:09:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this is a shadow game.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.65,0:09:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Goreskoloth, it's time to\Nwage war with Izdiabound!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.57,0:09:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm witnessing the\Norigin of Duel Monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.59,0:10:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No one who disrespects the\Npharaohs shall go unpunished. I
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.87,0:10:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,must be watching one of the\Nfirst shadow games ever played
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.05,0:10:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Goresgoloth, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.59,0:10:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Vanquish his Diabound!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.41,0:10:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Wing Sage Valgos, come forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.57,0:10:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.61,0:10:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He summoned another creature?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.95,0:10:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.99,0:10:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Only those in the royal court can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.83,0:10:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, how did you summon that beast?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.15,0:10:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You do not possess a Diadiank.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.37,0:10:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.65,0:10:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I paid a visit to your old pharaoh's tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.19,0:10:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And while I was paying my respects,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.65,0:10:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I might borrow a few\Nof his little toys like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.17,0:11:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see that you are interfering\Nwith forces beyond your control?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.31,0:11:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.67,0:11:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in complete control of these forces,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.15,0:11:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,thanks to your former king and his\Npersonal collection of monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.87,0:11:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You dare disturb the great protectors of\Nthe sacred crypt of King Aknam Cannon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.99,0:11:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Those creatures were placed there to\Nsafeguard the tomb of a great pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.79,0:11:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.45,0:11:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But I disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.21,0:11:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a tyrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.77,0:11:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He destroyed my village when\Nhe tried to fashion the Seven
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.13,0:11:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Millennium Items in a selfish\Nattempt to further his own power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.71,0:11:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So it was the previous pharaoh\Nthat created the Millennium Items?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.51,0:11:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.89,0:11:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,King Aknam Cannon put an end to the\Ngreat wars that ravaged our nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.69,0:11:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He brought peace and prosperity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.59,0:11:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He then created the\NSeven Millennium Items to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.19,0:11:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,ensure that harmony would\Nreign forever in Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.79,0:11:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.77,0:11:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he gave those tools to us,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.81,0:11:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,in order to keep the peace and\Nhelp rule the land with justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.59,0:12:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,As well as to thwart evildoers\Nnot unlike yourself, Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.55,0:12:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Evildoers?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.77,0:12:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.95,0:12:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The items were built to react with the inner\Ndarkness of the person that holds them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.31,0:12:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So the fact that the\Nseven of you wield these
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.77,0:12:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,items makes each and every\None of you an evildoer,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.65,0:12:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,just like your so-called Keeper\Nof the Peace, King Aknam Cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.79,0:12:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Your king wanted power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.75,0:12:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why he devised a plan to use the\Nseven items to control the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.43,0:12:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The secret lies in the\Nvillage of Kall 'Elna.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.19,0:12:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.41,0:12:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What you speak is treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.85,0:12:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But how can he possibly know\Nof the village of Kall 'Elna?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.11,0:12:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The secret of its existence\Nwas buried ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.35,0:12:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hidden deep beneath\Nthe sands of Kall 'Elna
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.03,0:12:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,lies a structure known\Nas the Millennium Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.65,0:12:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Place the seven items in this stone,\Nand ultimate power will be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.05,0:12:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he speak the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.59,0:12:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know where you came from, Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.61,0:12:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I do know where you must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.79,0:13:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, destroy him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.39,0:13:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There is nothing that would\Nplease me more, Master Ak 'Nadin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.15,0:13:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Let our shadow game continue as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.23,0:13:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But it won't be much of a battle\Nunless you summon something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.17,0:13:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I call upon Battle Ox, Bostet, Spiria.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.75,0:13:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Zalua, Cards, Illusion Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.79,0:13:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Magician, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.63,0:13:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to do better than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.37,0:13:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Dearbound, teach these\Namateurs how to really attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.29,0:13:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Engage with Helical Shockwave!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.17,0:13:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen such strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.37,0:13:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but he's outnumbered!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.21,0:13:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, allow me to attack again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.51,0:14:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Mahad, your creature\Nwould only be destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.53,0:14:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me try.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.01,0:14:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You will have another chance, but\Nwe need to weaken his monster first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.69,0:14:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Mystic Horsemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.87,0:14:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Take over, Karim.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.79,0:14:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,With the vast power of\Nthe Millennium Scale,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.09,0:14:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I invoke the spirits of Battle Ox and\NMystic Horsemen combined together!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.85,0:14:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be the origin of Monster Fusion!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.09,0:14:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, rabid horsemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.71,0:14:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now attack is diabound\Nwith battle axe swipe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.77,0:14:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Diabound, counterattack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.63,0:14:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like your pony's all tied up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.11,0:15:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I am afraid that won't last long. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.73,0:15:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahad, this is your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.89,0:15:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Then illusion magician, come hither.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.35,0:15:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate your power of binding illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.35,0:15:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears your monster is in a bind now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.09,0:15:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.01,0:15:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Diabal, helical shockwave!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.45,0:15:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How can this possibly be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.57,0:15:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,One man overpowering six guardians?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.03,0:15:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were you, Pharaoh, I would\Nconsider replacing your staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.09,0:15:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.75,0:15:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.66,0:15:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on sacred ground and\Nyour disrespect is appalling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.47,0:15:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems I've gotten a\Nrise out of his highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.77,0:15:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Please excuse me for not respecting\Na kingdom that destroyed my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.85,0:15:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Deerbound, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.87,0:16:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Spiria shield, activate!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.91,0:16:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Isis!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.57,0:16:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.39,0:16:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.29,0:16:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,One more attack by my Deerbound and\Nthis palace will be reduced to rubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.39,0:16:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave this palace before I remove you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.49,0:16:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Farrow, please allow us to\Nbattle this intruder for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.07,0:16:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura, is this the ultimate\Nshadow game you spoke of?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.69,0:16:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Trespassing on sacred ground and\Ntarnishing the very name of my ancestors?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.01,0:16:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You've always been despicable,\Nbut now you've reached a new low!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.93,0:16:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Farrow, all of a sudden\Nyou care about your ancestors?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.77,0:16:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Admit it, you don't know\Nthe first thing about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.29,0:16:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But here, maybe this will jog your memory!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.07,0:16:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.09,0:16:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,King Aknam Cannon,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.33,0:17:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I never imagined your return to\Nthe palace would be so disgraceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.43,0:17:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry you had to say this, Pharaoh,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.83,0:17:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,but we cannot let this\Nmonster continue to dishonor
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.03,0:17:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,our heritage by spouting\Nfalse accusations and lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.23,0:17:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And you mustn't believe anything he says\Nabout our former Pharaoh, King Aknam Cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.75,0:17:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He was kind and just.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.53,0:17:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Please trust me, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.27,0:17:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Justice lies with the Egyptian gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.13,0:17:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The Egyptian gods?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.19,0:17:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.11,0:17:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you and the former king\Nhave a lot of catching up to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.47,0:17:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,but we are in the middle\Nof something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.85,0:17:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And you interrupted me at the best part,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.45,0:17:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,just as my Dearbound was about\Nto deliver the finishing blow,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.59,0:17:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,forcing you into submission!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.59,0:17:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.50,0:17:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,any last words before\NI end this shadow game
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.47,0:17:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and seize control of\Nyour Millennium Items?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.01,0:17:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.92,0:17:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Deerbaum, bring me victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.59,0:17:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there, Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.65,0:17:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.56,0:17:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Too little, too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.63,0:17:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.99,0:18:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.11,0:18:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something you\Nseem to have forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.55,0:18:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to remind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.63,0:18:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I can call the Egyptian gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.21,0:18:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What does he mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.57,0:18:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be the legendary god monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.53,0:18:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you referring to the three Egyptian\Ngods that guard the pharaoh's tomb?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.49,0:18:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The scriptures state\Nthat only the chosen king
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.01,0:18:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,will know the names of\Nthese legendary monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.01,0:18:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait, does this mean you are\Nthe chosen king in the prophecy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.19,0:18:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Legendary gods of Egypt,\Nplease hear my call.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.63,0:18:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,In the name of every pharaoh that\Ncame before, I now beseech thee.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.71,0:18:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Awaken, mighty Obelisk, and rid\Nthe sacred palace of this darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.71,0:18:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Obelisk the Tormentor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.73,0:19:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.55,0:19:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk the Tormentor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.81,0:19:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack Fist of Fury!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.95,0:19:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Diabau, use the power of Blue Eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.95,0:19:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,White lightning attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.29,0:19:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I could swear I just heard Blue Eyes.
